    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make buttermilk biscuits from scratch. This recipe only requires a handful of ingredients, starting with all-purpose flour. After whisking the flour with baking powder, baking soda, and salt, add in cold butter and press until the mixture is crumbly. Mix in cold buttermilk to make the dough before patting a folding it. Once the biscuits have been cut out of the dough, bake them in the oven and enjoy these flaky and buttery breakfast biscuits!",
